ばりました。\nお仕事で失敗をしても、わたしは,一生懸命がんばってるあなたの味方だよ。\n……どう、かな？\n……そう。少しでも元気が出たなら、わたしもうれしいな。」", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@aitter_smz/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F540411208369594368%2FjEnVzcNr.jpeg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2ed00d6d88015d203ba8b68c8ec6bff0", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F540411208369594368%2FjEnVzcNr.jpeg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2ed00d6d88015d203ba8b68c8ec6bff0, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F540411208369594368%2FjEnVzcNr.jpeg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=138bea932e9074b1e6998b652cb8d9ed 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F540411208369594368%2FjEnVzcNr.jpeg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=780f3cff26038f96447bb43d72be6e47 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "voice", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1030891, "nc": 16}, {"path": "/@aitter_smz/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F540411208369594368%2FjEnVzcNr.jpeg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2ed00d6d88015d203ba8b68c8ec6bff0"